# Magda, the Hoardmaster: "Whenever you commit a crime, create a tapped Treasure token. This ability triggers only once
# each turn." Bot1's first Lightning Bolt at Bot2 on turn 1 makes a tapped Treasure; the second that turn is a crime too
# but makes none. Bolts on turn 3 and on Bot2's turn 4 (each a new turn) make the second and third Treasures.
# "Sacrifice three Treasures: ... Activate only as a sorcery": refused on Bot2's turn with three Treasures there; on turn
# 5 it sacrifices all three (the only three, so none is asked for) and makes a 4/4 red Scorpion Dragon with flying and
# haste, which attacks at once (Bot2 at 20 - 12 - 4 = 4).

